      },
      "raw_locator": [
        {
          "book": "JOB",
          "chapter": 24,
          "verse": 9
        }
      ],
      "en": "There are those who pluck the fatherless from the breast, and take a pledge of the poor,",
      "ko": "어떤 사람은 고아를 어미 품에서 빼앗으며 가난한 자의 옷을 볼모 잡으므로",
      "source_text_hash": "0b9f5ea9ad3df7f55c0a7f6ca344e49cdf4a339d5d8ea4732d9da292b5fdb010",
      "translation_text_hash": "4d05a98b60cf3271549932d59e1cfe9b282c52fc75ecad7f9b7d5eeb43b471be",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
        "어떤 사람은 고아를 어미 품에서 빼앗으며 가난한 자의 옷을 볼모 잡으므로"
      ],
      "raw_text_hashes": [
        "4d05a98b60cf3271549932d59e1cfe9b282c52fc75ecad7f9b7d5eeb43b471be"
      ]
    },
    {
