      "en": "They make oil within the walls of these men. They tread wine presses, and suffer thirst.",
      "ko": "그 사람의 담 안에서 기름을 짜며 목말라하면서 술 틀을 밟느니라",
      "source_text_hash": "afb2334e8f827e25daa00b4d1f8b59736458fcd794a6508a4b54c4b4444a9209",
      "translation_text_hash": "20344bf314912f606f61ecdbaa4ee9c384a37b8cfcf2b315a7b6f4aaeac2b57f",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
