      "en": "The womb will forget him. The worm will feed sweetly on him. He will be no more remembered. Unrighteousness will be broken as a tree.",
      "ko": "태가 그를 잊어버리고 구더기가 그를 달게 먹을 것이라 그는 기억함을 다시 얻지 못하나니 불의가 나무처럼 꺾이리라",
      "source_text_hash": "7945995703e4bf6f4a52714374e78297052d18bfbf287e3ddb944b3b38b916dd",
      "translation_text_hash": "4e35a832ecb5b83f28e5690271beab78ce03dc10e7593a026d2623f4eba3efa9",
